accrueInterest.tree
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert with MarketPaused
└── when market is not paused
    ├── given irm is zero address
    │   └── it should return without updating interest
    └── given irm is not zero address
        ├── it should call IIrm.updateInterestRate
        ├── it should increase totalBorrowed.assets by interest amount
        ├── it should increase claimableFeesAssets by interest amount
        └── it should emit AccrueInterest event 